    "Active energy plus the resting energy your body would have used anyway over the same period. When the session recorded no resting energy, this falls back to the active number alone, so the two tiles can read exactly the same." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Active energy plus the resting energy your body would have used anyway over the same period. When the session recorded no resting energy, this falls back to the active number alone, so the two tiles can read exactly the same."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活动消耗加上同一时段内你本来也会消耗的静息能量。当这次训练没有记录静息能量时，它会退回为只显示活动消耗的数值，因此两个图块可能完全相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
