    "Body reads Apple Health data locally to power the app and widgets." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Body reads Apple Health data locally to power the app and widgets."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Body 在本地读取健康 App 数据，为 App 和小组件提供支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Body scores each night from the data available for that sleep window: amount, continuity, start time consistency, deep and REM share, pressure from sleep HRV, sleep vitals, and skin temperature. Pressure, vitals, and temperature are graded against your own recent overnight baselines — sleep vitals use the same typical bands as the Vitals chart, so an outlier there costs points in proportion to how far it sits outside your band — and the total is calibrated so only truly strong nights score high. Missing sensors are skipped instead of counted as zero." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Body scores each night from the data available for that sleep window: amount, continuity, start time consistency, deep and REM share, pressure from sleep HRV, sleep vitals, and skin temperature. Pressure, vitals, and temperature are graded against your own recent overnight baselines — sleep vitals use the same typical bands as the Vitals chart, so an outlier there costs points in proportion to how far it sits outside your band — and the total is calibrated so only truly strong nights score high. Missing sensors are skipped instead of counted as zero."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Body 会根据该睡眠时段可用的数据为每晚评分：睡眠量、连续性、入睡时间规律性、深睡和快速眼动占比、睡眠心率变异性带来的压力、睡眠体征以及皮肤温度。压力、体征和体温会与你近期的夜间基准进行比较评分，其中睡眠体征采用与生命体征图表相同的典型范围，数值偏离该范围越远、扣分也越多，总分经过校准，只有真正优质的夜晚才会得高分。缺失的传感器数据会被跳过，而不会按零分计算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Body sets up your dashboard with your Apple Health data. This one-time load can take a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Body sets up your dashboard with your Apple Health data. This one-time load can take a moment."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Body 正在使用你的健康 App 数据准备仪表盘。首次载入可能需要一点时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
