    "How far you traveled during the session, from GPS where it was available and from motion sensors otherwise. Indoor workouts fall back to motion, so a treadmill distance can differ from the machine's own readout." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How far you traveled during the session, from GPS where it was available and from motion sensors otherwise. Indoor workouts fall back to motion, so a treadmill distance can differ from the machine's own readout."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这次训练中你移动的距离，有 GPS 信号时来自 GPS，否则来自运动传感器。室内训练只能依靠运动传感器，因此跑步机上的距离可能与器械自身显示的数值不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far your heart rate fell during the first minute after you stopped. A larger drop generally points to better cardiovascular fitness, and your own usual range tells you more than any single reading." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How far your heart rate fell during the first minute after you stopped. A larger drop generally points to better cardiovascular fitness, and your own usual range tells you more than any single reading."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你停下后第一分钟内心率下降的幅度。下降越多通常说明心血管适能越好，而你自己的常见范围比任何单次读数都更有参考价值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many pedal revolutions you turned per minute. It needs a device or paired sensor that records cadence, so it will not appear on every ride." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How many pedal revolutions you turned per minute. It needs a device or paired sensor that records cadence, so it will not appear on every ride."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你每分钟踩踏的圈数。它需要能记录踏频的设备或配对的传感器，因此并非每次骑行都会显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many steps you took per minute, counting both feet. At a given pace, a higher cadence usually means shorter strides and less impact through each one." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How many steps you took per minute, counting both feet. At a given pace, a higher cadence usually means shorter strides and less impact through each one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你每分钟迈出的步数，双脚都计算在内。在相同配速下，步频更高通常意味着步幅更短，每一步的冲击也更小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much moisture was in the air where you worked out. High humidity makes it harder for your body to shed heat, which can raise your heart rate at a pace that normally feels easy." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How much moisture was in the air where you worked out. High humidity makes it harder for your body to shed heat, which can raise your heart rate at a pace that normally feels easy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你训练所在环境空气中的水汽含量。湿度高时身体更难散热，可能让你在平时轻松的配速下心率升高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
