    "Levels compare you against people of the same age and sex. Add your date of birth and sex in the Health app to see yours. Levels are available from age 20 through 79." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Levels compare you against people of the same age and sex. Add your date of birth and sex in the Health app to see yours — they are available from age 20 through 79."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分级会将你与同龄同性别的人进行比较。请在“健康”App 中填写你的出生日期和性别以查看你的水平。该分级适用于 20 至 79 岁。"
          }
        }
      }
