    "Metabolic equivalents, a measure of intensity where 1 MET is roughly the energy you use sitting still. An average of 8 METs means the session took about eight times that." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Metabolic equivalents, a measure of intensity where 1 MET is roughly the energy you use sitting still. An average of 8 METs means the session took about eight times that."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代谢当量，一种强度衡量方式，其中 1 MET 大致相当于你静坐时的能量消耗。平均 8 METs 表示这次训练约为静坐时的八倍。"
