            "value" : "对比标记"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The energy your body used through movement during this session, above what it would have burned at rest. This is the number Apple Health credits toward your Move ring." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The energy your body used through movement during this session, above what it would have burned at rest. This is the number Apple Health credits toward your Move ring."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这次训练中你通过运动消耗的能量，即在静息消耗之上多出的部分。这就是「健康」计入你「活动」圆环的数值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highest single beats-per-minute reading recorded during the session. A loose watch band or cold skin can produce a brief spike that does not reflect real effort." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The highest single beats-per-minute reading recorded during the session. A loose watch band or cold skin can produce a brief spike that does not reflect real effort."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这次训练中记录到的最高每分钟心跳次数。表带过松或皮肤偏凉都可能产生一次并不反映真实强度的短暂峰值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last refresh failed: %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The last refresh failed: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上次刷新失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The long image uses a gradient background." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The long image uses a gradient background."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长图使用渐变背景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The number of steps you took per day" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The number of steps you took per day"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你每天的步数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The small badge above a tile's unit compares that value against your average for the same workout type over the 30 days before this session. It shows direction only, with no judgment about whether higher is better: an up arrow means this workout was above that average, a down arrow means below, and a value near zero means you were on par. While the history is still loading the badge holds a 0% stand-in and the label beside Details reads Calculating, then the digits roll into the real percentage. Once loading has settled without enough comparable history the badge reads --%, because a zero there would wrongly claim the metric matched your average. Some tiles carry no badge at all, either because the metric has no comparable value or because it arrived after the comparison was built." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The small badge above a tile's unit compares that value against your average for the same workout type over the 30 days before this session. It shows direction only, with no judgment about whether higher is better: an up arrow means this workout was above that average, a down arrow means below, and a value near zero means you were on par. While the history is still loading the badge holds a 0% stand-in and the label beside Details reads Calculating, then the digits roll into the real percentage. Once loading has settled without enough comparable history the badge reads --%, because a zero there would wrongly claim the metric matched your average. Some tiles carry no badge at all, either because the metric has no comparable value or because it arrived after the comparison was built."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图块单位上方的小标记，会将该数值与这次训练之前 30 天内同类型训练的平均值进行对比。它只显示方向，并不判断高低好坏：向上箭头表示这次训练高于该平均值，向下箭头表示低于平均值，接近零则表示与平常持平。历史数据仍在加载时，标记会先显示 0% 占位，「详情」旁的说明显示为正在计算，随后数字会滚动为真实百分比。当加载结束但可对比的历史仍然不足时，标记会显示 --%，因为此时显示零会错误地表示该指标与你的平均值持平。有些图块完全没有标记，可能是该指标没有可对比的数值，也可能是它在对比生成之后才加载进来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The total climbing you did, adding up every uphill section rather than measuring the difference between your start and finish. A barometric altimeter measures this more accurately than GPS alone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The total climbing you did, adding up every uphill section rather than measuring the difference between your start and finish. A barometric altimeter measures this more accurately than GPS alone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你累计的爬升高度，把每一段上坡逐一相加，而不是计算起点与终点的高度差。气压高度计测量这一项比仅靠 GPS 更准确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The total number of swim strokes counted across the session, added up over every length you swam." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The total number of swim strokes counted across the session, added up over every length you swam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这次训练中统计到的划水总次数，按你游过的每一趟累加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These tiles summarize what Apple Health recorded for this workout. Which tiles appear depends on the workout type and on the device that recorded the session, so a workout without heart-rate or GPS data simply shows fewer of them. Most values come straight from Apple Health, and a few, such as pace, speed, and cadence, are worked out by Body from the distance, duration, and counts Apple Health stored." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These tiles summarize what Apple Health recorded for this workout. Which tiles appear depends on the workout type and on the device that recorded the session, so a workout without heart-rate or GPS data simply shows fewer of them. Most values come straight from Apple Health, and a few, such as pace, speed, and cadence, are worked out by Body from the distance, duration, and counts Apple Health stored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些图块概括了「健康」为这次训练记录的数据。显示哪些图块取决于训练类型以及记录这次训练的设备，因此没有心率或 GPS 数据的训练只会显示较少的图块。大多数数值直接来自「健康」，少数数值（例如配速、速度和步频）由 Body 根据「健康」存储的距离、时长和计数推算得出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
