    },
    "When on, Apple Intelligence writes a short comment about what's shaping today's readiness score, including your heart rate, HRV, sleep, and training signals. Everything runs on your device, and your health data never leaves it. When off or unavailable, Body shows its built-in explanation instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, Apple Intelligence writes a short comment about what's shaping today's readiness score, including your heart rate, HRV, sleep, and training signals. Everything runs on your device, and your health data never leaves it. When off or unavailable, Body shows its built-in explanation instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，Apple 智能会写下一句简短点评，说明是什么在影响今天的恢复状态分数，包括你的心率、心率变异性、睡眠和训练信号。全部处理都在你的设备上完成，健康数据不会离开设备。关闭或不可用时，Body 会改为显示自带的说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, Body estimates a 1-10 effort for each workout from available workout, heart-rate, recent history, and readiness data. The suggestion appears on workout details and pre-fills unrated effort edits; your saved ratings stay in control, and unchanged accepted suggestions are excluded from future calibration." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, Body estimates a 1-10 effort for each workout from available workout, heart-rate, recent history, and readiness data. The suggestion appears on workout details and pre-fills unrated effort edits; your saved ratings stay in control, and unchanged accepted suggestions are excluded from future calibration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，Body 会根据可用的运动、心率、近期历史和恢复状态数据，为每次运动估算 1 到 10 的强度。该建议会出现在运动详情中，并预填尚未评分的强度；你保存的评分始终优先，未修改就采纳的建议不会计入未来校准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, Body fills in effort for you, but only when it's confident. Some workouts get filled and others are left for you to rate:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, Body fills in effort for you, but only when it's confident. Some workouts get filled and others are left for you to rate:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，Body 会替你填写强度，但只在足够有把握时才填写。有些运动会被自动填写，有些则留给你自己评分："
          }
        }
      }
    },
