            "value" : "你的活动能量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your average beats per minute across the session. Warm-up and cool-down are included, so it usually sits below the effort you felt at your hardest." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your average beats per minute across the session. Warm-up and cool-down are included, so it usually sits below the effort you felt at your hardest."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整次训练的平均每分钟心跳次数。热身和放松阶段都会计入，因此它通常低于你在最吃力时的实际感受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your average distance covered per hour, worked out from the total distance and the full elapsed time. Stops at traffic lights and rest periods are included, so this usually reads lower than the speed you held while actually moving." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your average distance covered per hour, worked out from the total distance and the full elapsed time. Stops at traffic lights and rest periods are included, so this usually reads lower than the speed you held while actually moving."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每小时移动的平均距离，由总距离和全部经过时间推算得出。等红灯和休息时间都会计入，因此这个数值通常低于你实际移动时保持的速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your average mechanical output in watts, which is how much work you actually did rather than how hard it felt. Unlike heart rate it responds instantly and is not pushed around by heat, caffeine, or fatigue." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your average mechanical output in watts, which is how much work you actually did rather than how hard it felt. Unlike heart rate it responds instantly and is not pushed around by heat, caffeine, or fatigue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的平均机械输出功率（瓦），它反映你实际做了多少功，而不是你感觉有多吃力。与心率不同，它响应即时，也不会受高温、咖啡因或疲劳影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your average time to cover one kilometer or one mile, following your distance unit setting. It is worked out from the total distance and the full elapsed time, so warm-up, slow sections, and any rests are all counted in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your average time to cover one kilometer or one mile, following your distance unit setting. It is worked out from the total distance and the full elapsed time, so warm-up, slow sections, and any rests are all counted in."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你的距离单位设置，跑完一公里或一英里所用的平均时间。它由总距离和全部经过时间推算得出，因此热身、慢速路段以及任何休息都会计入其中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your average time to swim 100 meters or 100 yards, following your distance unit setting. It is based on the total distance and the full elapsed time, so rest between sets is counted in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your average time to swim 100 meters or 100 yards, following your distance unit setting. It is based on the total distance and the full elapsed time, so rest between sets is counted in."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你的距离单位设置，游完 100 米或 100 码所用的平均时间。它基于总距离和全部经过时间，因此每组之间的休息也会计入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
